                    },
                    "message": "I'm not in love with this naming scheme for multi-unit entries.\n\nIdeally should be:\n\nTemperatureName\nPressureName\nHumidityName\n\nAs properties, but I get we've used the default \"name\" to define the temp sensor in other places, so I guess this is fine."
